## Preserve current decisions when summarizing older snapshots
An earlier healthy snapshot cannot override a current failure or required follow-up. Include the authoritative findings in summary inputs, and keep mandatory status or next-step wording deterministic when model prose could dismiss it. Check downstream lesson writes as well as the displayed sentence.
```python
# bad: this input omits the newer halted-maintenance finding
note = summarize(previous_health_snapshot)
```
```python
# good: required follow-up cannot become an all-clear sentence
if requires_followup(current_findings):
    note = "Maintenance findings require follow-up; review the evidence and next steps."
else:
    note = summarize(previous_health_snapshot)
```
